      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing TTS Provider**\n\nI've decided to move forward with Google Cloud Text-to-Speech as the external TTS provider for `synthesize_text.py`. It's a solid choice for the project. The decision will now be clearly reflected in the code.\n\n\n**Defining the Python File**\n\nI'm now implementing the `synthesize_text.py` file. The core function will leverage Google Cloud Text-to-Speech. I'm focusing on incorporating the specific provider elements into the code, like the `google.cloud.texttospeech` import and `texttospeech.TextToSpeechClient`, to clearly indicate the external TTS provider used.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789865644216,
          "start": 1789865641424
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc4e45d0001IVcUMvVStLf2H0",
